{"id":301,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为缅怀革命英烈，弘扬爱国主义精神，3月31日上午，化学与化工学院组织师生党员赴太原双塔革命烈士陵园开展“缅怀革命先烈，传承红色精神”清明祭扫活动。</p><p>太原双塔革命烈士陵园是为纪念解放太原中光荣牺牲的革命烈士，于1954年在双塔寺南侧修建的烈士陵园。整座陵园庄严肃穆、国槐成荫、翠柏环绕。师生们在雄伟的纪念碑前，向革命先烈敬献花篮并鞠躬致哀。共同回顾了先烈们的英勇事迹，深切表达了对先烈们的崇高敬意和无限哀思。随后师生们重温入党誓词，激励各自不断进取，奋斗终身。</p><p>此次活动，既是一次爱国主义教育课，又是一次重温革命历史的“红色洗礼”课。大家纷纷表示，作为新时代党员，要铭记历史，不忘初心、牢记使命，为学校双一流创建和学院事业高质量发展而贡献全部力量。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nM8VSVUN78LRNinz7rfn7-bM7lPUlnlkMm7bn7W2L8nkU8-0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyDMYhfUYyZMzffMlLaU4CinlLaU4UbLlr2MzffolQRUmTFM4TkMNWVolVFUzGDo7CJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUbg4NbMzvJqdrnx&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=9957&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/067AC850A5C0C65EC0C491EF50A9FCB9/79B6BE9A/A068F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nM8VSVUN78LRNinz7rfn7-bM7lPUlnlkMm7bn7W2L8nkU8-0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyDMYhfUYyZMzffMlLaU4CinlLaU4UbLlr2MzffolQRUmTFM4TkMNWVolVFUzGDo7CJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUbg4NbMzvJqdrnx&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=9957&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nnRASVnRlYMRlYLz8MfMNlYMz74M8Vl7LN7sLlL8UzWknl-0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhRMSyYMkyDM4LZUmn7oRCiMNLiMN-aMR7Dozf7ozG8M4nFnRNZMm9iL7VFnlMkLRCJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUbg4NbMzvJqdrnx&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=9957&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DC5246738B4D8656C56B041690D90474/D986850A/ECB06\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nnRASVnRlYMRlYLz8MfMNlYMz74M8Vl7LN7sLlL8UzWknl-0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhRMSyYMkyDM4LZUmn7oRCiMNLiMN-aMR7Dozf7ozG8M4nFnRNZMm9iL7VFnlMkLRCJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUbg4NbMzvJqdrnx&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=9957&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nLzQS7MzUYolU8LzNnknRUaM7Q7MzUl4L4fVUll4M4vsLll0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyDU1hRLSh2nmC8LzTfMNM7ozMfUzWkU4LYL7n2MmNYL4AFLmlDLRCYL46FnRVkLRLJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUbg4NbMzvJqdrnx&oid=1384834961&tid=1049&nid=9957&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/76BC1FF6419A6CD93AA2BC320DF69238/25606237/D1B03\" vheight=\"\" vwidth